WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.504 --> 00:00:07.004
- Hey Gar, I got us friendship milkshakes!

00:00:08.101 --> 00:00:10.561
(yelling) what the hell?

00:00:10.561 --> 00:00:11.865
- Please leave for the day.

00:00:11.865 --> 00:00:13.374
- What, milkshakes, why?

00:00:13.374 --> 00:00:15.533
- I have a girl over,
she thinks I live alone.

00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:18.627
And I just, come on, I
haven't gotten any strange

00:00:18.627 --> 00:00:19.948
in weeks.

00:00:19.948 --> 00:00:20.781
- But--

00:00:20.781 --> 00:00:22.399
- Come on, I'll pay you back later, maybe,

00:00:22.399 --> 00:00:24.730
sometime, probably not.

00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:26.813
- I left my stuff inside.

00:00:28.271 --> 00:00:29.415
- Take those straws out
of your ears, you look

00:00:29.415 --> 00:00:30.998
like a while devil.

00:00:33.499 --> 00:00:34.916
- Son of a bitch.

00:00:58.207 --> 00:01:00.855
- [Operator] Whoa whoa
whoa, what are you doing?

00:01:00.855 --> 00:01:02.089
- Operator?

00:01:02.089 --> 00:01:03.498
- [Operator] You shouldn't be here.

00:01:03.498 --> 00:01:04.864
- I was just trying to
call home and say hi

00:01:04.864 --> 00:01:05.717
to my mom.

00:01:05.717 --> 00:01:07.800
- [Operator] Hang up now.

00:01:13.085 --> 00:01:15.660
- Sorry I don't have any bread today guys.

00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:19.131
Hope we can still be
friends, where you going?

00:01:19.131 --> 00:01:19.964
Okay.

00:01:21.214 --> 00:01:22.381
I miss my mom.

00:01:26.649 --> 00:01:29.066
(chattering)

00:01:31.301 --> 00:01:32.134
- Yeah.

00:01:32.134 --> 00:01:34.099
- Give me a hug.

00:01:34.099 --> 00:01:34.932
Okay, bye.

00:01:34.932 --> 00:01:35.765
- Bye.

00:01:41.062 --> 00:01:42.641
- [Kate] Finally!

00:01:42.641 --> 00:01:43.474
- How?

00:01:43.474 --> 00:01:46.143
- [Kate] Well I didn't do well
out I the real world, Garrick

00:01:46.143 --> 00:01:48.255
so I came back here, I was
going to hang out in the

00:01:48.255 --> 00:01:51.094
back yard but I figured it
was close to your bedroom,

00:01:51.094 --> 00:01:54.510
so I sat on the front porch,
then I thought you'd see me,

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:56.445
so I came up here.

00:01:56.445 --> 00:01:57.841
- Yeah, good plan.

00:01:57.841 --> 00:02:00.574
- [Kate] Yeah, also do we have a ladder?

00:02:00.574 --> 00:02:02.936
All the steps I saw on the
way up disa-friggin-ppeared

00:02:02.936 --> 00:02:03.942
on the way down.

00:02:03.942 --> 00:02:06.350
- No, no we don't have a ladder.

00:02:06.350 --> 00:02:07.714
- [Kate] Okay, well can you go find one?

00:02:07.714 --> 00:02:09.640
- You want me to just go
up to a neighbor and say

00:02:09.640 --> 00:02:11.632
"oh hey do you have a ladder available?"

00:02:11.632 --> 00:02:12.465
- [Kate] Yes.

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:16.411
- I'm not gonna frickin'
do that, why would I...

00:02:16.411 --> 00:02:18.578
You just throw an acorn at
me, that's not even an acorn

00:02:18.578 --> 00:02:20.101
tree, where'd you get an acorn from?

00:02:20.101 --> 00:02:23.403
- [Kate] Bitch, get me a ladder!

00:02:23.403 --> 00:02:27.236
- I swear to God, I
fucking hate this garbage.

00:02:29.227 --> 00:02:32.214
Kate, this is Tyler, he has a ladder.

00:02:32.214 --> 00:02:33.047
- Hi.

00:02:33.047 --> 00:02:35.819
- Hi, hey, nice to meet you.

00:02:35.819 --> 00:02:39.069
I actually don't need a ladder anymore.

00:02:42.453 --> 00:02:43.611
I'm okay though.

00:02:43.611 --> 00:02:45.361
- Oh, what a re-leaf.

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:50.707
(sensual music)

00:02:57.201 --> 00:03:01.034
- Okay, well I'm glad
that's over, right guys?

00:03:02.213 --> 00:03:03.994
We can move on with our lives.

00:03:03.994 --> 00:03:06.745
- Do you like goat milk ice cream, Tyler?

00:03:06.745 --> 00:03:08.290
- No.

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:09.290
- Me either.

00:03:10.575 --> 00:03:12.470
Do you wanna go not eat some inside?

00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:13.303
- Yes.

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:16.077
- Hey, um, your ladder!

00:03:22.239 --> 00:03:23.572
It's not fair...

00:03:29.863 --> 00:03:31.877
Oh come on, you guys
aren't even gonna hook up

00:03:31.877 --> 00:03:33.292
anyway, you're on your period!

00:03:33.292 --> 00:03:34.630
- You don't know that!

00:03:34.630 --> 00:03:38.630
- Yeah I do man, look I
got the little schedule.

00:03:39.868 --> 00:03:43.399
- So you knew how rude today was.

00:03:43.399 --> 00:03:47.541
You are gonna stay out here
until I'm good and done.

00:03:47.541 --> 00:03:49.958
(stuttering)

00:03:51.077 --> 00:03:53.577
(funky music)

